1:["$","main",null,{"className":"site article-page","children":["$","div",null,{"className":"article-frame","children":[["$","a",null,{"className":"desktop-brand","href":"/","children":["$","span",null,{"className":"letter-cascade is-in","aria-label":"Thinkinghaus","children":[["$","b","T-0",{"aria-hidden":"true","style":{"--letter-cascade-index":0},"children":"T"}],["$","b","h-1",{"aria-hidden":"true","style":{"--letter-cascade-index":1},"children":"h"}],["$","b","i-2",{"aria-hidden":"true","style":{"--letter-cascade-index":2},"children":"i"}],["$","b","n-3",{"aria-hidden":"true","style":{"--letter-cascade-index":3},"children":"n"}],["$","b","k-4",{"aria-hidden":"true","style":{"--letter-cascade-index":4},"children":"k"}],["$","b","i-5",{"aria-hidden":"true","style":{"--letter-cascade-index":5},"children":"i"}],["$","b","n-6",{"aria-hidden":"true","style":{"--letter-cascade-index":6},"children":"n"}],["$","b","g-7",{"aria-hidden":"true","style":{"--letter-cascade-index":7},"children":"g"}],["$","b","h-8",{"aria-hidden":"true","style":{"--letter-cascade-index":8},"children":"h"}],["$","b","a-9",{"aria-hidden":"true","style":{"--letter-cascade-index":9},"children":"a"}],["$","b","u-10",{"aria-hidden":"true","style":{"--letter-cascade-index":10},"children":"u"}],["$","b","s-11",{"aria-hidden":"true","style":{"--letter-cascade-index":11},"children":"s"}]]}]}],["$","article",null,{"className":"article-column","data-content-slug":"the-silent-type","data-content-title":"The silent type","children":[["$","header",null,{"className":"article-header","children":[["$","h1",null,{"children":"The silent type"}],["$","p",null,{"children":"July 1, 2026"}],["$","p",null,{"children":"2 minutes"}],["$","p",null,{"className":"author-edit-action","hidden":true,"children":["$","a",null,{"href":"https://thinkinghaus-studio.maxpfennighaus.workers.dev/","children":"Edit"}]}]]}],["$","div",null,{"className":"article-body","children":[[["$","p","0-Untitled Sans began as an attempt to make another typeface plainer.",{"className":"$undefined","children":["Untitled Sans began as an attempt to make another typeface plainer."]}],["$","p","1-Kris Sowersby removed some of its more noticeable details, got a little lost and put the project away, came back to it several years later, and nearly threw it out. It was only after reading about the [Super Normal](https://jaspermorrison.com/publications/essays/super-normal) that he found a way to understand the thing he’d already been making: maybe being deliberately ordinary was enough of a reason for a typeface to exist.",{"className":"$undefined","children":["Kris Sowersby removed some of its more noticeable details, got a little lost and put the project away, came back to it several years later, and nearly threw it out. It was only after reading about the ",["$","a","1",{"href":"https://jaspermorrison.com/publications/essays/super-normal","rel":"noreferrer","children":["Super Normal"]}]," that he found a way to understand the thing he’d already been making: maybe being deliberately ordinary was enough of a reason for a typeface to exist."]}],["$","p","2-I love that the explanation arrived late in the game. I can identify. I try things. I change my mind. I forget why I started. I wander into something better. Occasionally I understand what I was doing after I’ve already done it.",{"className":"$undefined","children":["I love that the explanation arrived late in the game. I can identify. I try things. I change my mind. I forget why I started. I wander into something better. Occasionally I understand what I was doing after I’ve already done it."]}],["$","p","3-Sowersby describes deliberately removing traces of his own recognizable style from the letters, scrubbing his fingerprints off the [crime scene.](https://www.btp.police.uk/police-forces/british-transport-police/areas/about-us/about-us/our-history/crime-history/great-train-robbery/?utm_source=chatgpt.com)",{"className":"$undefined","children":["Sowersby describes deliberately removing traces of his own recognizable style from the letters, scrubbing his fingerprints off the ","$La"]}],"$Lb","$Lc","$Ld","$Le","$Lf","$L10"],"$L11"]}],"$L12"]}]]}]}]
a:["$","a","1",{"href":"https://www.btp.police.uk/police-forces/british-transport-police/areas/about-us/about-us/our-history/crime-history/great-train-robbery/?utm_source=chatgpt.com","rel":"noreferrer","children":["crime scene."]}]
b:["$","p","4-That sounds almost perverse for a designer. We’re encouraged to make things distinctive, ownable, memorable—something that can stand up in a presentation and explain why it deserves to exist.",{"className":"$undefined","children":["That sounds almost perverse for a designer. We’re encouraged to make things distinctive, ownable, memorable—something that can stand up in a presentation and explain why it deserves to exist."]}]
c:["$","p","5-But most of the time, when I’m reading, I don’t need the typeface to introduce itself. I need it to help me *read*.",{"className":"$undefined","children":["But most of the time, when I’m reading, I don’t need the typeface to introduce itself. I need it to help me ",["$","em","1",{"children":["read"]}],"."]}]
d:["$","p","6-That’s probably why Untitled Sans feels right for both my [portfolio](http://maxpfennig.haus/) and for Thinkinghaus. The work and the writing can wander around and follow unusual ideas. The letters stay put.",{"className":"$undefined","children":["That’s probably why Untitled Sans feels right for both my ",["$","a","1",{"href":"http://maxpfennig.haus/","rel":"noreferrer","children":["portfolio"]}]," and for Thinkinghaus. The work and the writing can wander around and follow unusual ideas. The letters stay put."]}]
e:["$","p","7-Its plainness isn’t an absence of design. It’s what happens when a mountain of small decisions are made thoughtfully enough that they can recede. The type makes some room around the words instead of elbowing them for attention.",{"className":"$undefined","children":["Its plainness isn’t an absence of design. It’s what happens when a mountain of small decisions are made thoughtfully enough that they can recede. The type makes some room around the words instead of elbowing them for attention."]}]
f:["$","p","8-I find that deeply appealing: work that has clearly been thought about, but doesn’t make you stop every five minutes to admire how much thinking went into it.",{"className":"$undefined","children":["I find that deeply appealing: work that has clearly been thought about, but doesn’t make you stop every five minutes to admire how much thinking went into it."]}]
10:["$","p","9-Work that knows how to be [quiet](https://openlibrary.org/works/OL15626048W/No_such_thing_as_silence).",{"className":"$undefined","children":["Work that knows how to be ",["$","a","1",{"href":"https://openlibrary.org/works/OL15626048W/No_such_thing_as_silence","rel":"noreferrer","children":["quiet"]}],"."]}]
